@startuml UC-54
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-54.md
title UC-54: View Order Detail (Admin)
footer Feature AORD-02 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-28
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/OrdersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "OrderService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Open an order
MVC -> API : GET /api/admin/orders/{id}
API -> SVC : GetOrderAsync(id)
SVC -> DB : Load order + items + customer (FullName, Email, Phone)
alt not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Order not found"
else found
  SVC --> API : OrderAdminDetailDto\n(item snapshots, amounts, payment incl. TransactionCode,\ncustomer info) (BR-28)
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show order detail with actions:\nupdate status (UC-55), cancel (UC-56), payment (UC-57)
end

@enduml
